      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Case Action Request",
      "id": "action-request",
      "intro": "Fitur Action Request pada Case Acquirer digunakan untuk mengajukan dan mengelola tindakan (misalnya: eskalasi case, penutupan case massal, dll.) yang memerlukan proses approval berlapis sebelum dieksekusi oleh sistem.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Mengajukan Action Request",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Tombol Action Request:** Tersedia di panel detail Case (Case Summary) atau melalui opsi di tabel.\n• **Proses Pengajuan:** Saat diklik, akan muncul dialog formulir untuk menentukan jenis tindakan yang ingin diajukan terhadap Case tersebut.\n• Anda wajib memasukkan alasan atau catatan tambahan untuk dievaluasi oleh approver (Checker).",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.08);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;width:320px;background:#fff;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:16px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Submit Case Action Request</div></div><div style=\"padding:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;\">Action Type <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:8px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#0f172a;\">CLOSE CASE</span><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\"/></svg></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;\">Remarks <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:8px;height:60px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#0f172a;\">Semua alert di dalam case ini terbukti false positive.</span></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:16px;border-top:1px solid #f1f5f9;display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:10px;background:#f8fafc;\"><button style=\"padding:8px 16px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;color:#64748b;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"padding:8px 16px;border-radius:8px;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border:none;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;\">Submit Request</button></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Proses Approval (Checker View)",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Evaluasi Request:** User dengan role Checker akan melihat request di tab/tabel Action Request.\n• Checker dapat menyetujui (**Approve**) atau menolak (**Decline**) request yang diajukan.\n• Jika disetujui, tindakan terhadap kumpulan alert dalam Case tersebut akan tereksekusi secara otomatis oleh sistem.",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;width:340px;background:#fff;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:16px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:4px;\">Action Approval Review</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#64748b;\">Review case action request #CAS-99120</div></div><div style=\"padding:20px;background:#f8fafc;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:2px;\">Action Type</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">CLOSE CASE</div></div><div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:2px;\">Maker Remarks</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#475569;\">Semua alert di dalam case ini terbukti false positive.</div></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:16px 20px;border-top:1px solid #f1f5f9;display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:flex-end;\"><button style=\"padding:8px 16px;border-radius:8px;background:#fee2e2;color:#b91c1c;border:1px solid #fecaca;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;\">Decline</button><button style=\"padding:8px 16px;border-radius:8px;background:#16a34a;color:#fff;border:none;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;\">Approve Request</button></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
